1
00:00:03,360 --> 00:00:06,480
Download a folder of images of different apples

2
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,000
Unzip the folder

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
In the ‘Apple’ class

4
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,880
add some samples of images

5
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:14,240
from one of the folders you have just downloaded

6
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:18,120
Choose images that look most like your red apple

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:21,720
Навчи модель

8
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:24,440
Test the model again by holding up your red apple

9
00:00:24,440 --> 00:00:26,040
to your webcam

10
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:28,160
The model should make a more confident prediction

11
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:30,400
that it is an apple

12
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,720
Hold up your tomato to your webcam

13
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,840
The model might make a less confident prediction

14
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:37,000
that it is a tomato

15
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
This is because you have added training data

16
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,240
to the apple class

17
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:47,000
of images that look more like tomatoes

